  "text": "The RHF offers an integrated portfolio of interventions including buy-backs, raising, retrofitting, and demolition/rebuild options, allowing for tailored solutions based on property and household needs. It is supported by a 50:50 cost-sharing model between state and federal governments under DRFA Category D, and includes a Property Level Flood Information Portals Program to enhance risk awareness and inform decision-making.",
